# ============================================================================
# Vajra OS — live-build integration for packaging
# ============================================================================
# This file configures live-build to install Vajra OS packages from the
# Vajra APT repository during ISO build. This means the ISO installs
# vajra-desktop, vajra-core, vajra-security-center, etc. from our repo
# instead of just copying scripts.
#
# To use: copy this to live-build/config/package-lists/vajra.list.chroot
# ============================================================================

# === Vajra OS Core Packages ===
# These are installed from the Vajra APT repository (repo.vajra-os.org)
# The repo and GPG key are added during build via live-build hooks

# Keyring and sources (must be first so apt can verify packages)
vajra-keyring
vajra-sources

# Core system
vajra-core

# Desktop and applications
vajra-desktop

# Individual packages (pulled by vajra-desktop, listed for clarity)
vajra-security-center
vajra-control-center
vajra-package-manager
vajra-update-manager
vajra-buddhi-ai

# === Base system packages ===
# These come from Debian repos
task-gnome-desktop
firefox-esr
libreoffice
gimp
vlc
gparted
gnome-terminal
network-manager
ufw
fonts-noto-core
apt-utils
